.TH garuda-toolbox-boot 1  "garuda-toolbox 6.3.0" 
.SH NAME
garuda\-toolbox\-boot \- Set the boot menu: default entry, timeout, kernel parameters, looks
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgaruda\-toolbox boot\fR [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-pager\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR \fIWHEN\fR] [\fB\-\-width\fR \fICOLUMNS\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set the boot menu: default entry, timeout, kernel parameters, looks
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Print the programs\*(Aq own words under an error
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-pager\fR
Print long text directly instead of through `$PAGER`
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Colour the output: auto, always or never
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-width\fR \fI<COLUMNS>\fR
Cut long cells to this many columns
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Leave out the spinner and the hints
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-boot\-show(1)
The boot menu\*(Aqs settings as they are now
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-boot\-entries(1)
The entries of the boot menu, for `boot set default`
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-boot\-set(1)
Change one setting of the boot menu, then regenerate it
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-boot\-param(1)
Add or remove a kernel parameter
.SH EXTRA
Example:
  garuda\-toolbox boot set timeout 3
.SH "SEE ALSO"
garuda\-toolbox(1)
